 >HEAD

   DATAID="TIPONLY1"
   ACQBY="AusMT test fixture"
   PROSPECT="Tipper-only fixture"
   LOC="Fixture"
   LAT=-18.69
   LONG=138.53
   ELEV=  0.00

 >INFO   MAXLINES=1000

   MINTED FIXTURE - NOT CUSTODIAN DATA. The block layout reproduces the shape of
   the regenerated magnetometer-array registry files in the AusMT corpus, measured
   on the carpentaria-north-1995 station Adels_Cove - a three-channel DEFINEMEAS
   with no EMEAS, an MTSECT naming HX/HY/HZ only, and a TIPPER block with no
   impedance section anywhere in the file. No byte is copied from a corpus file.
   The header identity is invented and the tipper values below are minted for this
   test. The point of the fixture is the ABSENCE - a station that never carried an
   impedance, so nothing masks it and nothing derives an apparent resistivity or a
   phase from it.

 >=DEFINEMEAS

   MAXCHAN=3
   MAXRUN=999
   MAXMEAS=99999
   UNITS=M
   REFTYPE=CART
   REFLAT=-18.69:0:0
   REFLONG=138.53:0:0
   REFELEV=  0.00

 >HMEAS ID= 1001.001 CHTYPE=HX X = 0.  Y = 0.  AZM = 0.
 >HMEAS ID= 1002.001 CHTYPE=HY X = 0.  Y = 0.  AZM= 90.
 >HMEAS ID= 1003.001 CHTYPE=HZ X = 0.  Y = 0.  AZM= 0.

 >=MTSECT
  SECTID= TIPONLY1
   NFREQ=    6
   HX = 1001.001
   HY = 1002.001
   HZ = 1003.001

 >!****FREQUENCIES****!
 >FREQ NFREQ= 6  ORDER=DEC // 6
    0.16667E-02    0.83333E-03    0.41667E-03    0.26042E-03    0.13021E-03    0.65104E-04
 >!****TIPPER PARAMETERS****!
 >TXR.EXP ROT=0.0 // 6
   -0.24400E+00   -0.19000E+00   -0.19300E+00   -0.18600E+00   -0.12900E+00   -0.91900E-01
 >TXI.EXP ROT=0.0 // 6
   -0.57500E-01   -0.10100E+00   -0.92500E-01   -0.11400E+00   -0.10900E+00   -0.89800E-01
 >TXVAR.EXP ROT=0.0 // 6
    0.10000E-01    0.10000E-01    0.10000E-01    0.10000E-01    0.10000E-01    0.10000E-01
 >TYR.EXP ROT=0.0 // 6
   -0.97200E-01   -0.12100E+00   -0.16700E+00   -0.24700E+00   -0.21100E+00   -0.23300E+00
 >TYI.EXP ROT=0.0 // 6
    0.13700E+00    0.10500E+00    0.94100E-01    0.99900E-01    0.51700E-01    0.19900E-01
 >TYVAR.EXP ROT=0.0 // 6
    0.10000E-01    0.10000E-01    0.10000E-01    0.10000E-01    0.10000E-01    0.10000E-01

 >END
